    <string name="reset_title">Reset Alpine environment?</string>
    <string name="reset_text">Alpine is deleted and set up again from scratch: downloaded again, and its packages reinstalled.</string>
    <string name="reset_keep">Keep installed Flatpaks</string>
    <string name="reset_keep_hint">Installed apps, runtimes, remotes and the Flatpak configuration are moved aside and put back afterwards; they are not downloaded again. Each app\'s settings and data are kept.</string>
    <string name="reset_wipe_hint">Everything installed with Flatpak is deleted as well, including each app\'s settings and data, and Flatdroid\'s settings. Files in Documents/Flatdroid are not touched.</string>
